translate pt strings:

    old "A child, she thought, would be something she could give him that would weigh up to all he gave her."
    new "Uma criança, pensou ela, seria algo que poderia dar a ele e pesaria tanto quanto tudo o que ele lhe dera."

    old "A priest, older than her but younger than her soon-to-be-husband, stood near the altar."
    new "Um sacerdote, mais velho do que ela mas mais jovem do que seu futuro marido, estava perto do altar."

    old "A bed, some storage, nothing of note."
    new "Uma cama, alguns armários, nada de nota."

    old "A bolt of pleasure shot through her body as she felt him press the tip up against her pussy."
    new "Um raio de prazer disparou pelo seu corpo enquanto ela sentiu ele pressionar a ponta contra sua boceta."

    old "A near madness came over her, tears flowing past her face, as she found herself begging him a third time."
    new "Uma quase loucura a tomou, lágrimas escorrendo pelo rosto, enquanto ela se via implorando por ele pela terceira vez."

    old "A home. A safe place in this world that belonged to her."
    new "Um lar. Um lugar seguro neste mundo que lhe pertencia."

    old "A boy, they cried out."
    new "Um menino, gritaram eles."
